{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>You will set them</b> — <b>Your face</b> [is] like a glowing oven. <b>You will swallow them</b> [is] as it were, for <b>their fruit</b> You will not find, and she shall have no <b>sons</b> [left]. And there are those who say: [the matter of] כ <b>like a flaming oven</b> is as bet, in the manner of: בחצי לילה (in the middle of the night), כחצות הלילה (at midnight)."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:28:05.470259910Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}